            </note>
            <note corresp="#d76-f2" n="2" xml:id="d76-f2-content">
                <p>Not printed; renewed recommendations concerning railway operation contained in
                    telegram from the Consul at Harbin, Feb. 3, 3 p.m., <ref
                        target="frus1918Russiav03#pg_219">vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">iii</hi>,
                        p. 219</ref>, and added suggestions for publicity in Russia concerning
                    America.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
